  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nUnder certain circumstances, chromium will crash due to an attempt to fetch an instruction from null called from WebCore::RenderTable::firstLineBoxBaseline. This occurs after performing DOM insertions and removals on a document included in a second using an iframe."
